# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo tracks ONLY the general fitting framework:
#   Fitter.py  DataCardMaker.py  Utils.py  doFit.py  fit_signalshapes.py
#   interpolation.py  makePostfitPlot.py  run_fit_adaptive.py
#   CMS_lumi.py  tdrstyle.py  dimuonX_config.json (example config)
#
# Everything below is a particular APPLICATION of the framework (the dimuon
# search: its automation, one-off validation tooling, and outputs). It is kept
# locally but deliberately not tracked, so the repo stays general.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# One-off / study tooling and archived study results
